WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.840
Number four, your relationships and your connections.

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:05.300
Think about your family, your personal, your intimate.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.220
and your professional relationships.

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:08.700
Do you feel supported?

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.340
Can you communicate honestly?

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:11.580
Can you be yourself?

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:13.540
And do you have your boundaries respected?

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:14.780
Do you have boundaries?

00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:15.267
Number five, your career, your work, and your business.

